1qad|n|The act of referring, or the state of being referred; as, reference to a chart for guidance. ; That which refers to something; a specific direction of the attention; as, a reference in a text-book. ; Relation; regard; respect. ; One who, or that which, is referred to. ; One of whom inquires can be made as to the integrity, capacity, and the like, of another. ; A work, or a passage in a work, to which one is referred. ; The act of submitting a matter in dispute to the judgment of one or more persons for decision. ; The process of sending any matter, for inquiry in a cause, to a master or other officer, in order that he may ascertain facts and report to the court. ; Appeal.	a:vpp,60,6;19ir,52,7;uih,39,18;r6k,22,3;202v,22,5;289y,21,9;1z33,17,5;wh3,16,6;uaq,12,4;w2z,12,27;10s,12,3;14st,8,5;v56,4,4~w2z,12,27;uih,39,18;289y,21,9;19ir,52,7;vpp,60,6;wh3,16,6;202v,22,5;14st,8,5;1z33,17,5;uaq,12,4;v56,4,4;10s,12,3;r6k,22,3	v:h71,30,2;18ju,6,4~18ju,6,4;h71,30,2	V:18r4,56,12;11tr,41,4;12cm,6,5~18r4,56,12;12cm,6,5;11tr,41,4	n:h71,40,4;d6g,24,4;29lz,14,3~h71,40,4;d6g,24,4;29lz,14,3	N:18r7,75,10;18r5,68,21;1sjv,64,3;16sq,52,35;16sj,52,50;1r6v,51,9;1kj8,43,6;1r6r,42,15;29lz,38,16;158h,32,6;17br,31,20;1l55,25,9;1l4t,23,26;14cj,21,2;b00,18,3~16sj,52,50;16sq,52,35;1l4t,23,26;18r5,68,21;17br,31,20;29lz,38,16;1r6r,42,15;18r7,75,10;1r6v,51,9;1l55,25,9;19bs,4,6;158h,32,6;1kj8,43,6;1xwa,15,5;28hv,15,5
1qad|v|The act of referring, or the state of being referred; as, reference to a chart for guidance. ; That which refers to something; a specific direction of the attention; as, a reference in a text-book. ; Relation; regard; respect. ; One who, or that which, is referred to. ; One of whom inquires can be made as to the integrity, capacity, and the like, of another. ; A work, or a passage in a work, to which one is referred. ; The act of submitting a matter in dispute to the judgment of one or more persons for decision. ; The process of sending any matter, for inquiry in a cause, to a master or other officer, in order that he may ascertain facts and report to the court. ; Appeal.	o:1r6v,19,1;14cj,11,1~1r6v,19,1;14cj,11,1
