1ren|n|The state of being responsible, accountable, or answerable, as for a trust, debt, or obligation. ; That for which anyone is responsible or accountable; as, the resonsibilities of power. ; Ability to answer in payment; means of paying.	a:16kl,53,6;ekh,43,3;1n5m,38,2;uaq,28,2;1xnv,8,6~1xnv,8,6;16kl,53,6;ekh,43,3;1n5m,38,2;uaq,28,2	v:22b4,42,15;22b9,39,3~22b4,42,15;22b9,39,3
